# Per-developer cargo config (machine-specific OPENSSL_DIR etc.). A hardcoded
# absolute path here breaks Linux/macOS + CI, so it is NOT tracked. Windows
# devs: copy .cargo/config.toml.example → .cargo/config.toml and set your path.
.cargo/config.toml

# Real production icons land in Phase 13 (Doc 26). The placeholders
# `src-tauri/icons/icon.ico` (Windows) and `src-tauri/icons/icon.png` (the
# default window icon on Linux/macOS, required by tauri::generate_context!)
# ARE committed so cargo + tauri-build run out of the box on every platform.
